<refentry version="5.1"
  xml:id="Api.SilikoTokenDestroy"
  xmlns="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook">
<refmeta>
  <refentrytitle>SilikoTokenDestroy</refentrytitle>
</refmeta>

<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoTokenDestroy</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to deallocate a token</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Token.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">void SilikoTokenDestroy(SilikoToken *object);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoTokenDestroy</function> function deletes
<varname>object</varname>. If <varname>object</varname> is an
identifier, the string value is deallocated as well.</para>
</refsection>
</refentry>
